map <leader>;r <action>(org-netbeans-modules-project-ui-actions-ActiveConfigAction)
desc <leader>;r run configuration
map <leader>;s <action>(org-netbeans-modules-options-OptionsWindowAction)
desc <leader>;s settings
map <leader>;T <action>(toggle-toolbar)
desc <leader>;T editor toolbar
map <leader>;z <action>(org-netbeans-core-windows-actions-ShowEditorOnlyAction)
desc <leader>;z editor only

" --- SPC a — activate windows ------------------------------------------------
" NetBeans has no Gradle, Maven, Coverage, Task or AI window, so those
" ideameow slots are unbound here; F files and x favorites are the NetBeans
" windows with no ideameow counterpart.
