" --- SPC g — git / goto / generate -------------------------------------------
desc <leader>g git / goto / generate
map <leader>ga <action>(org-netbeans-modules-git-ui-actions-AddAction)
desc <leader>ga git add
map <leader>gb <action>(org-netbeans-modules-git-ui-blame-AnnotateAction)
